From eb8b7e34ceef23fe14d78ab97a70a4fdbd97de32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:43:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): snapshots panel (t74, muse-worker-03)

Snapshots section lists the caller's VM checkpoints, creates one with a label validated by the shared server regex, and restores one behind a confirm dialog; API errors surface via the toast layer.

- lib/vm/snapshot-label.ts: browser-safe home for SNAPSHOT_LABEL_RE + validateSnapshotLabel + snapshotLabelError (no node imports, so the minimalist UI can import the exact server rule instead of a divergent client copy); docker-driver.ts now re-exports it.
- lib/client/snapshots.ts: typed fetch helpers for GET/POST /api/runtime/vm/snapshots (SnapshotsError, describeSnapshotsError).
- minimalist-ui SnapshotsPanel: list (newest first), create form with live inline label validation, restore confirm dialog, toasts on failure; wired in as a fifth Computer view (tab, mobile tab, Cmd/Ctrl+5).
- Tests: snapshot-label.test.ts (shared regex) + client/snapshots.test.ts (list/create/restore/error mapping); keymap test extended for Cmd/Ctrl+5.

Path correction: the task named apps/swarmagents-final/, which does not exist (renamed to apps/swarmagents/ in 50046ea9); all work is in apps/swarmagents/. No API/auth/middleware changes; no new dependencies.
